  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Long Hair Ancestor was a rank eight Gu Immortal. The immortal essence he left in Lang Ya blessed land is white litchi immortal essence. One hundred green grape immortal essence beads cannot compare to one white litchi immortal essence bead.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Attackers pouring green grape beads into the land try to exhaust that leftover store; Lang Ya blessed land also holds rank eight Heavenly Essence Treasure Imperial Lotus and is said never to lack white litchi immortal essence while that Gu still produces.",
      "chapters": [
        464
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_heavenly_essence_treasure_lotus"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortals at rank eight have immortal apertures that create white litchi immortal essence. They face a heavenly tribulation every ten years, a grand tribulation every fifty years, and a myriad tribulation every one hundred years. After three myriad tribulations, they would become rank nine Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        1007
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-eight-schedule",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong’s immortal essence is named as something only rank eight Gu Immortals have: white litchi immortal essence.",
      "chapters": [
        1389
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-eight-schedule",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Rank scale sits on ranks and realms.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-eight-schedule",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_ranks_and_realms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "One bead of white litchi immortal essence is in some sense a hundred beads of red date immortal essence, which is ten thousand beads of green grape immortal essence. Ten thousand immortal essence stones convert into one white litchi immortal essence bead, a rate the text calls simply too bad.",
      "chapters": [
        1644
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "conversion-cost",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Purely refining immortal essence stones into white litchi immortal essence has the same ten-thousand-to-one cost.",
      "chapters": [
        1681
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "conversion-cost",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Most rank eight Gu Immortals therefore produce and store their own beads rather than buy conversion at that rate.",
      "chapters": [
        1644
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "conversion-cost",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
